{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Find and take object, if object visible then approach, check properties then perform task.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveTowardsObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = PerformTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInReach    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    />",
